2396 003400  0000  HBSETUP,.-.                     /HANDLER, BUFFER SETUP ROUTINE
2397               
2398               /       WE FIRST ATTEMPT TO ALLOCATE EACH OF THE I/O HANDLERS, INPUT AND OUTPUT (OR
