2426               /      AT THIS POINT, THE WORK TABLE CONTAINS THE AVAILABLE PAGE COUNT FOR ALL
2427               /       VIABLE FIELD ENTRIES AFTER THE HANDLER LENGTHS HAVE BEEN SUBTRACTED ON A
2428               /       BEST FIT BASIS. WE MUST NOW FIND THE LARGEST REMAINING BUFFER SPACE (TWO
2429               /       BUFFERS ARE REQUIRED IF EITHER COPYING WITH VERIFY (NOT /N), OR VERIFY-ONLY,
2430               /       ELSE ONLY ONE).
