2593               /      BUFFER SETUP ROUTINE.
2594               
2595               /       ALLOCATES A BUFFER OF AC-PASSED SIZE IN THE FIELD PASSED INLINE.
2596               
2597               /       THE WORK TABLE ELEMENT IS REDUCED BY THIS SIZE AND THE BUFFER ADDRESS PASSED
2598               /       BACK IN THE AC. TO PREVENT HANDLER-RELATED PROBLEMS, THE BUFFER IS ALLOCATED
2599               /       FROM THE REAR OF THE FIELD.
2600               
2601               /       CALL WITH:
2602               
2603               /       TAD     (BUFSIZE)       /AC CONTAINS BUFFER SIZE (ZERO IS INNOCUOUS)
